OL,3,GNEWSAPlumes of smoke as blaze forces
OL,4,Aroad closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlumes of thick smoke could be seen
OL,7,Fabove Birmingham city centre after a
OL,8,Fblaze broke out and forced roads to be
OL,9,Fshut.
OL,11,FA number of crews were called to a
OL,12,Fblaze on Great Hampton Street, near the
OL,13,Fcity's Jewellery Quarter, at about
OL,14,F11:00 BST, West Midlands Fire Service
OL,15,F(WMFS) said.
OL,17,FFirefighters used hose reel jets, a
OL,18,Fhydraulic platform and a drone to
OL,19,Ftackle the blaze, thought to have
OL,20,Fstarted accidentally and is now under
OL,21,Fcontrol.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
