OL,3,GNEWSAPlumes of smoke as blaze forces
OL,4,Aroad closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreat Hampton Street and Constitution
OL,7,FHill, between Northwood Street and
OL,8,FHalford Street, have been reopened, but
OL,9,FBarr Street remains closed, WMFS said.
